# Era 1 of The Quota (year 0, harvest to the first frost; design/eras/era1.md): its nine new places wired as
# areas on their own plates (package W3-C, 2026-10-22; render/places/q1_*.mjs, baked by render/bake_era1.sh).
# Loaded by the shell beside wiring/quota-areas.lwd (ui/app.mjs content=quota). The places era 1 shares with era 2
# (the post, the hill, the Haldane kitchen, the Sheaf) stay in quota-areas.lwd and take their harvest variant
# while var.era is 1.
# hud-clock and hud-weather: the hour and the weather the HUD shows here while @meta hud-held holds (era 1 runs
# on no clock of its own: every era 1 node costs 0 minutes, content/quota/e1_world.lwd), read by ui/hudtab.mjs.
# No figures yet: era 1's cast has no sculpted figures; the scenes' speakers show on the talk page only.

# ---------------------------------------------------------------- the wide lens: the district at harvest
@area q1.exchange
name: The exchange hall, Exchange Street
plate: q1_exchange
place: q1_exchange
lens: wide
variant: harvest
hud-clock: 15:10
hud-weather: harvest, warm
spawn: 0 0 1.5
camera: 0.6

